<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.relay.rotates ~ rotate ~ a fresh relay key

`lares intent-relay rotate` replaces the relay's admission key and answers the new public key; every face the relay serves answers under it after the roll.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`rotate` params=`~ a fresh relay key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ json

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/json`>>

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the operator's switch over this vessel's own relay, through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ rotated · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`rotated` params=`exit/0 ~ the new relay key`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ [lares intent-relay] refused: names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

